		<link>http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/12/goorin-bros-nye-prefunk-party/</link>
		<comments>http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/12/goorin-bros-nye-prefunk-party/#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Tue, 29 Dec 2009 06:46:49 +0000</pubDate>
