		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://bluescholars.com/blog/?p=1024</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[
Come through, Seattle. Pops off on The Ave right before the Washington vs. Oregon State Pac-10 opener. The Grand Opening party (photos) we rocked back in October was dope, as this will surely be.
Oh, did I mention that this event is FREE?
   ]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-1026" title="tumblr_kvehmj0T4m1qzrt8yo1_500" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/12/tumblr_kvehmj0T4m1qzrt8yo1_5001.jpg" alt="tumblr_kvehmj0T4m1qzrt8yo1_500" width="467" height="700" /></p>
<p>Come through, Seattle. Pops off on The Ave right before the Washington vs. Oregon State Pac-10 opener. The <a href="http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/10/photos-goorin-bros-seattle-grand-opening/">Grand Opening party (photos)</a> we rocked back in October was dope, as this will surely be.</p>
<p>Oh, did I mention that this event is <strong>FREE</strong>?</p>
<p align="left"><a class="tt" href="http://twitter.com/home/?status=Check+@bluescholars+Goorin+Bros.+NYE+Prefunk+Party+http://tinyurl.com/ybwnk8b" title="Post to Twitter"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-twitter-micro3.png" alt="Post to Twitter" /></a> <a class="tt" href="http://digg.com/submit?url=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/12/goorin-bros-nye-prefunk-party/&amp;title=Goorin+Bros.+NYE+Prefunk+Party" title="Post to Digg"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-digg-micro3.png" alt="Post to Digg" /></a> <a class="tt" href="http://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/12/goorin-bros-nye-prefunk-party/&amp;t=Goorin+Bros.+NYE+Prefunk+Party" title="Post to Facebook"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-facebook-micro3.png" alt="Post to Facebook" /></a> <a class="tt" href="http://www.myspace.com/Modules/PostTo/Pages/?l=3&amp;u=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/12/goorin-bros-nye-prefunk-party/&amp;t=Goorin+Bros.+NYE+Prefunk+Party&amp;c=%3Cp%3EPowered+by+%3Ca+href%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Frichardxthripp.thripp.com%2Ftweet-this%22%3ETweet+This%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E" title="Post to MySpace"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-myspace-micro3.png" alt="Post to MySpace" /></a></p>]]></content:encoded>
