		<item>
		<title>MUSIC: Bambu &#8220;The Queen Is Dead&#8221;</title>
		<link>http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/12/music-bambu-the-queen-is-dead/</link>
		<comments>http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/12/music-bambu-the-queen-is-dead/#comments</comments>
		<pubDate>Mon, 28 Dec 2009 06:53:23 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator>Blue Scholars</dc:creator>
				<category><![CDATA[The Music]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Bambu]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[The Queen is Dead]]></category>

		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://bluescholars.com/blog/?p=1029</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[
The first leaked track, produced by Fatgums, off the upcoming Bambu EP Paper Cuts, dropping February 23, 2010! The EP also features the track &#8220;Slow Down&#8221; (produced by MTK) featuring Geo/Prometheus Brown. Bam is also currently working on a project entirely produced by Sabzi. Download the track at 2dopeboyz.com.
   ]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-1030" title="TQID-COVER" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/12/TQID-COVER.jpg" alt="TQID-COVER" width="500" height="499" /></p>
<p>The first leaked track, produced by <strong>Fatgums</strong>, off the upcoming <strong>Bambu</strong> EP <strong><em>Paper Cuts</em></strong>, dropping February 23, 2010! The EP also features the track &#8220;Slow Down&#8221; (produced by <strong>MTK</strong>) featuring Geo/Prometheus Brown. Bam is also currently working on a project entirely produced by Sabzi. <a href="http://2dopeboyz.okayplayer.com/2009/12/27/bambu-the-queen-is-dead/">Download the track at 2dopeboyz.com</a>.</p>
<p align="left"><a class="tt" href="http://twitter.com/home/?status=Check+@bluescholars+MUSIC%3A+Bambu+%E2%80%9CThe+Queen+Is+Dead%E2%80%9D+http://tinyurl.com/ya3ttld" title="Post to Twitter"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-twitter-micro3.png" alt="Post to Twitter" /></a> <a class="tt" href="http://digg.com/submit?url=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/12/music-bambu-the-queen-is-dead/&amp;title=MUSIC%3A+Bambu+%E2%80%9CThe+Queen+Is+Dead%E2%80%9D" title="Post to Digg"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-digg-micro3.png" alt="Post to Digg" /></a> <a class="tt" href="http://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/12/music-bambu-the-queen-is-dead/&amp;t=MUSIC%3A+Bambu+%E2%80%9CThe+Queen+Is+Dead%E2%80%9D" title="Post to Facebook"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-facebook-micro3.png" alt="Post to Facebook" /></a> <a class="tt" href="http://www.myspace.com/Modules/PostTo/Pages/?l=3&amp;u=http://bluescholars.com/blog/2009/12/music-bambu-the-queen-is-dead/&amp;t=MUSIC%3A+Bambu+%E2%80%9CThe+Queen+Is+Dead%E2%80%9D&amp;c=%3Cp%3EPowered+by+%3Ca+href%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Frichardxthripp.thripp.com%2Ftweet-this%22%3ETweet+This%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fp%3E" title="Post to MySpace"><img class="nothumb" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/plugins/tweet-this/icons/tt-myspace-micro3.png" alt="Post to MySpace" /></a></p>]]></content:encoded>
