			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img class="alignnone size-full wp-image-1022" title="HI808" src="http://bluescholars.com/blog/wp-content/uploads/2009/12/HI808.jpg" alt="HI808" width="448" height="348" /></p>
<p>In case you missed it on <strong>MTVu</strong> and online, or you want to see it on the big(ger) screen, watch our &#8220;HI-808&#8243; music video on <strong>Comcast On Demand</strong> (go to Music &gt; Music Choice &gt; Hip-Hop &amp; R&amp;B). By the way, although all 808 limited edition physical copies of the OOF! EP are gone, you can still cop the digital packages <a href="http://bluescholars.com/store/">right here</a>.</p>
