		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://bluescholars.com/blog/?p=1009</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[If any of you are in the New York area tomorrow night, Sabzi is going to be a part of a little festival presented by his friends Das Racist called MINORITYFEST.
Performances!
Ali Wong, Sheng Wang, Hari Kondabolu, Kumail Nanjiani, Das Racist (ft. Sabzi), Gordon Voidwell, Po Po, and Despot!
Discussion!
Panel comprised of a racially diverse array of [...]]]></description>
			<content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="wp-caption alignnone" style="width: 410px"><img src="http://4.bp.blogspot.com/_xkip9kL6bC4/SwHxSdlDkZI/AAAAAAAABR8/86GqL_L_tA8/s400/dasracist.jpg" alt="Das Racist" width="400" height="267" /><p class="wp-caption-text">(the 3rd best picture of Das Racist on the internet)</p></div>
<p>If any of you are in the New York area tomorrow night, <strong><a href="http://www.aref-adib.com/archives/ghormehsabzi2007.jpg">Sabzi</a> </strong>is going to be a part of a little festival presented by his friends <strong><a href="http://www.myspace.com/dasracist">Das Racist</a></strong> called MINORITYFEST.</p>
<p>Performances!</p>
<p><a href="http://www.aliwong.com/"><strong>Ali Wong</strong></a>, <a href="http://www.myspace.com/shengwang"><strong>Sheng Wang</strong></a>, <strong><a href="http://www.harithecomic.com/">Hari Kondabolu</a></strong>, <a href="http://www.myspace.com/5kumails"><strong>Kumail Nanjiani</strong></a>, Das Racist (ft. Sabzi), <a href="http://www.myspace.com/gordonvoidwell"><strong>Gordon Voidwell</strong></a>, <strong><a href="http://www.myspace.com/popobros">Po Po</a></strong>, and <a href="http://www.myspace.com/despotroast"><strong>Despot</strong></a>!</p>
<p>Discussion!</p>
<p>Panel comprised of a racially diverse array of artists, academics, comedians and writers discussing what they do and issues they face as artists of color. The panel will be moderated by Himanshu Suri and Ashok Kondabolu of Das Racist.</p>
<p>Should be fun.  Doors are at 7pm (December 11th) and the show is at <a href="http://www.glasslands.com/"><strong>Glasslands</strong></a>.</p>
<p>if you aren&#8217;t hip to Das Racist, check out a remix of one of their more popular songs below&#8230;<br />
<object classid="clsid:d27cdb6e-ae6d-11cf-96b8-444553540000" width="425" height="344" codebase="http://download.macromedia.com/pub/shockwave/cabs/flash/swflash.cab#version=6,0,40,0"><param name="allowFullScreen" value="true" /><param name="allowscriptaccess" value="always" /><param name="src" value="http://www.youtube.com/v/lUe8enz27sg&amp;hl=en_US&amp;fs=1&amp;" /><param name="allowfullscreen" value="true" /><embed type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="425" height="344" src="http://www.youtube.com/v/lUe8enz27sg&amp;hl=en_US&amp;fs=1&amp;" allowscriptaccess="always" allowfullscreen="true"></embed></object></p>
